H2b Call the find of the map directly, without function pointers, with a switch. Against include/ of 4e036ed.
The same walk as H2a. A value is a pointer and a type index; each operation is a switch over the index with the code of each type inline.
The switch rebuilds what std::visit does; it enters the tree only after the owner has seen the measurement of H2a against H2b.
